# Disaster-recovery working directories.
# Encrypted backup sets, manifests and any decrypted material produced by the DR
# tooling stay on the operator machine. A backup set is customer data under a
# key; committing one would put the whole platform's contents in git history.
.dr-backups/
*.dump
*.dump.enc
